const VIEWS=[["dash","Tableau de bord","dash"],["items","Articles","box"],["moves","Mouvements","swap"],["reports","Rapports","chart"],["order","À commander","list"],["inventory","Inventaire","check"],["ateliers","Ateliers","box"],["dests","Destinations","pin"],["log","Journal","list"]];
function renderShell(){
